        "abstract": "The recent space mission, which returned to explore the moon, and the exciting new views of the universe through the James Webb Space Telescope have allowed us to successfully venture into new frontiers thanks to innovative technologies. The first communication from space using laser technologies was also one of the recent notable achievements that marked a new era for space exploration technologies. Interestingly, approaches that were once considered in the realm of science fiction, like asteroid mining for securing in-space resources like water to create fuel, are on their way to becoming a reality.",
